item+ function src/render.rs :: integrate_page :: pub fn integrate_page() -> String { :: The ways-to-use-it page: `/integrate`. A new writer meets the editor first; this page answers the next question — where a bundle can go. Four doors, in order: the reader's own LLM over MCP, their WordPress, their own hosting, and the edit.phext.io vault for drafts that should travel with them. It closes with one sentence of kin for tluf.org. It is kept by the Pencil Puffball, worn once as a round badge in the opening — inside the hairline ring, the artwork's cream ground reads deliberately in both themes. :: direct :: api
